OL,3,ARussia accuses Ukraine of attacking oil
OL,4,Arefinery after Zelensky says strikes to
OL,5,Aresume
OL,6,
OL,7,FZelensky also accused the US of
OL,8,Fwithdrawing intelligence-sharing on
OL,9,FRussian strikes to pressure Kyiv into
OL,10,Fending the attacks altogether after it
OL,11,Fstruck a deal to import Russian diesel,
OL,12,Fand said restrictions to Starlink
OL,13,Fsatellite services used by Ukraine's
OL,14,Fmilitary were deliberate.
OL,16,FThe Kremlin has since said Kyiv
OL,17,F"attempted a large-scale attack" on a
OL,18,Frefinery south of Moscow early on
OL,19,FThursday.
